    <string name="fadsec_info">KCam is an independent fork of FadCam by FadSec Lab, licensed under GPL-3.0. Upstream credit and source: github.com/anonfaded/FadCam.</string>
    <string name="app_description">
        <![CDATA[
    KCam is an ad-free, open-source recording app based on FadCam. No trackers, no ads, no analytics.
    <br/><br/>
    It is a GPL-3.0 fork: the original project is <font color="#cfbafd">FadCam</font> by FadSec Lab. KCam is not affiliated with or endorsed by FadSec Lab.
    ]]>
    </string>

